  "doc": "GENERATED from standard/profiles/operations/process-segment.json 3.0.0 by i3x-v5 packages/schemas-ci/gen-payloads.mjs; do not edit by hand. Kafka value schema (TopicNameStrategy), the same shape as the JSON payload (envelope fields + data). Types: DateTime → long timestamp-millis (UTC), Int32/Int64 → long, Float/Double → double, Json → string (JSON text); key and required attributes are not nullable, the others [null, T] default null.",
  "fields": [
